        "SRC008306",
        "SRC008308",
        "SRC008309",
        "SRC008312",
        "SRC008315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC072",
      "title": "Angels Over the Nation",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Your ministry is about to experience a growth coming that is already activated. Say it is activated already. This is declared not as a promise still to be earned but as something already set in motion, and it will come with a great testimony attached to it.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA283",
            "SRC008317",
            "SRC008320",
            "SRC008327",
            "SRC008329",
            "SRC008331"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008317",
            "SRC008320",
            "SRC008327",
            "SRC008329",
            "SRC008331"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA283"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000007",
          "provider_handle": "p7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Because God told me, and literally I saw it, I saw angels dancing over the nation. I saw that Cameroon has a destiny attached to it, and that vision is what grounds the conviction that there is a beautiful Cameroon coming.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA285",
            "SRC008367",
            "SRC008369",
            "SRC008371",
            "SRC008373",
            "SRC008374",
            "SRC008376"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008367",
            "SRC008369",
            "SRC008371",
            "SRC008373",
            "SRC008374",
            "SRC008376"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA285"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000008",
          "provider_handle": "p8"
        },
        {
          "text": "I know there is a beautiful Cameroon ahead, one in which the destiny of this nation is fulfilled: you will not need a visa to go to anywhere, you will be the jealousy of many nations, and in the church you will not find somebody sick there, because sickness will be banished from the church.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA284",
            "SRC008376",
            "SRC008380",
            "SRC008384",
            "SRC008388",
            "SRC008392",
            "SRC008393"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008376",
            "SRC008380",
            "SRC008384",
            "SRC008388",
            "SRC008392",
            "SRC008393",
            "SRC008367",
            "SRC008373"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA284"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        },
        {
          "text": "To release this, hold the hand of somebody near you and pray earnestly with that person.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA286",
            "SRC008399",
            "SRC008401"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008399",
            "SRC008401",
